@startuml
title UML API & View Routing Sequence Diagram - MVC Architecture (softeng26-XX)
autonumber

actor "Χρήστης Desktop" as DesktopUser
actor "Χρήστης Smartphone" as MobileUser
participant "UrbanAnalyticsController\n(mvc/backend/controllers.py)" as Controller
participant "PropertyEvaluationModel\n(mvc/backend/models.py)" as PropModel
participant "NeighborhoodAnalyticsModel\n(mvc/backend/models.py)" as NbModel
participant "EurostatMacroModel\n(mvc/backend/models.py)" as EuroModel

== 1. Απόδοση Ξεχωριστών Views (Desktop vs Smartphone) ==
DesktopUser -> Controller : GET /desktop
Controller --> DesktopUser : HTML View 1 (`desktop_view.html`)

MobileUser -> Controller : GET /mobile
Controller --> MobileUser : HTML View 2 (`mobile_view.html`)

== 2. Κλήσεις REST API προς τους MVC Controllers ==
DesktopUser -> Controller : GET /api/v1/properties/evaluate?lat=37.9648&lon=23.7265&radius=600&rooms=2
Controller -> PropModel : evaluate(37.9648, 23.7265, 600, 2)
PropModel --> Controller : Evaluation Model Dict
Controller --> DesktopUser : HTTP 200 JSON

MobileUser -> Controller : GET /api/v1/neighborhoods/analytics
Controller -> NbModel : compute_all()
NbModel --> Controller : 44 Neighborhood Models
Controller --> MobileUser : HTTP 200 JSON

DesktopUser -> Controller : GET /api/v1/macro/urban-audit?city=EL300
Controller -> EuroModel : get_urban_audit("EL300")
EuroModel --> Controller : Eurostat SDMX Model Dict
Controller --> DesktopUser : HTTP 200 JSON
@enduml
